{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449633","title":"AI jadi berguna ketika model digabung dengan database dan retrieval","desc":"Kecerdasan sistem AI paling nyata muncul ketika pretrained model dipasang ke data dan mekanisme pencarian, bukan saat model berdiri sendiri sebagai chat box.","updated":1777275740133,"created":1777272449631,"tags":["zettel","ai","rag","integration","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"4a861f0ebcea73629dccf5630809986f","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.rag","alias":"rag","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.rag"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.integration","alias":"integration","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.integration"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1187},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1235},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449633","id":"zettel.1777272449633","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1238},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1283},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":3,"offset":215},"end":{"line":6,"column":27,"offset":239},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449633"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"supporting-quote":{"type":"header","text":"Supporting quote","value":"supporting-quote","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini penting","value":"kenapa-ini-penting","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":30,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":37,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"ai-jadi-berguna-ketika-model-digabung-dengan-database-dan-retrieval\">AI jadi berguna ketika model digabung dengan database dan retrieval<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ai-jadi-berguna-ketika-model-digabung-dengan-database-dan-retrieval\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang penting di quote ini bukan sekadar bahwa model bisa dipanggil lewat API. Yang membuatnya jadi \"truly intelligent\" adalah kombinasi antara model, database, dan teknik retrieval. Itu menandai pergeseran dari model-centric thinking ke system-centric thinking.</p>\n<h2 id=\"supporting-quote\">Supporting quote<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#supporting-quote\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“I could combine these APIs with database and search techniques to build truly intelligent systems.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-penting\">Kenapa ini penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini menunjukkan bahwa nilai AI untuk developer tidak berhenti pada kemampuan model. AI menjadi berguna ketika ia dipasangkan dengan data yang relevan dan mekanisme pencarian yang memilih konteks yang tepat. Ini adalah blueprint awal untuk RAG dan banyak arsitektur AI aplikasi yang muncul setelahnya.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\"Combine\" berarti AI bukan produk tunggal, melainkan komponen dalam sistem komposit.</li>\n<li>\"Database\" membawa elemen memory/state/source-of-truth yang model pretrained sendiri tidak punya.</li>\n<li>\"Search techniques\" adalah cara memilih data relevan saat dunia nyata sudah terlalu besar untuk dimasukkan ke prompt sekaligus.</li>\n<li>\"Truly intelligent systems\" lahir dari arsitektur gabungan, bukan dari model sendirian.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I / Preface</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">rag (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">integration (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"sele